qnero-aggregator is derived from Quantus-Network/qp-zk-circuits
(https://github.com/Quantus-Network/qp-zk-circuits, MIT License), read at
version 4.4.0 on 2026-09-11. The derived parts are:

- src/recursive.rs              from wormhole/aggregator/src/common/recursive.rs
- src/artifacts.rs              from wormhole/aggregator/src/common/utils.rs
- src/config.rs                 from wormhole/aggregator/src/config.rs
- src/private_batch/*           structure and security properties, from
                                wormhole/aggregator/src/private_batch/*
- src/public_batch/*            structure and security properties, from
                                wormhole/aggregator/src/public_batch/*

The public-input layouts, the padding rule and the forwarding contract are
Qnero's own; see CHANGES.md and docs/CIRCUIT.md section 8.
